Z||000000||Haze_Performance||09-12-2001||08:43 PM||||I'm not sure if anyone is interested but I received this email today.. <BR> <BR>---------------------------------------------<P>PayPal has setup an account for those of you who would like to help those<BR>affected by the recent terrorist acts in the US. <P>PayPal will donate 100% of the proceeds to the National Disaster Relief Fund of<BR>the American Red Cross. The Red Cross is one of the best non-partisan relief<BR>organizations in the world and you can donate to them in confidence that your<BR>effort will help those in need at this time. <P>The link for donations.... <BR> <A HREF="http://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=p/gen/relief-outside" TARGET=_blank>http://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=p/gen/relief-outside</A> <P>Relief@PayPal.com<P>(edited for spelling)<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>                 <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">                 <BR></A><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole_6.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 09-12-2001).]||||reg||3
